Pattern 3: Prefix Sum
Prefix Sum is a technique where we precompute the cumulative sum of an array so that we can answer sum-related queries efficiently.
Q.Range Sum Query.
Q.Subarray Sum Equals K.
Q.Equilibrium Index.
Q.Continuous Subarray.
Prefix[i] = Sum of everything
from index 0 to index i

Recognition Keywords

Whenever you read:
Sum
Range Sum
Continuous Sum
Subarray Sum
Interval Sum
Running Sum
Prefix
Cumulative Sum
Immediately think: Prefix Sum

How to Build Prefix
Pseudocode
Prefix[0] = Array[0]
For i = 1 to n-1
Prefix[i] = Prefix[i-1] + Array[i]

Universal Formula
For any range
L
to
R
Range Sum = Prefix[R] - Prefix[L-1]

TIME

Build → O(n)

Query → O(1)
